      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of emptiness, of not recognizing yourself, is deeply unsettling, but it's also a sign that something needs to change. If the foundation feels gone, it might be time to look at what's underneath the surface to find a way to start rebuilding, even in small ways. Please consider speaking with someone who can help you explore these feelings and support you through this difficult transition.",
      "source": "target",
